    "title": "Michael Burry Sold Half His NVIDIA Puts Before Huang's Return Sparked a 31% Rally",
    "summary": "Michael Burry sold half his NVIDIA puts before Jensen Huang's return lifted the stock 31%, but he still holds a hedge.\nThe post Michael Burry Sold Half His NVIDIA Puts Before Huang's Return Sparked a 31% Rally appeared first on BeInCrypto.",
    "hasSummary": true,
